    "text": "flavorCNE.4.1: \"胡言乱语，正不必忧心。\""
  },
  {
    "file": "D:\\Users\\Eric Liu\\Documents\\Paradox Interactive\\Victoria 3\\nesnd-workbench\\backups\\pre-update-20261030T233944Z\\mod\\localization\\simp_chinese\\replace\\ce_usm_events_l_simp_chinese.yml",
    "sha256": "c736f53d59fbcb3213e45c1d18e5e6499121cf86fca9a79fa94bf471c33b1d4f",
    "line": 118,
    "text": "ce_usm_conflicts_within_reason: \"明朝朱姓，还是吴国郑氏？这对于中国南朝有能力参预政治的国人来说，是一个每分每秒都要自问的难题。从川边乡校的讲习台到南京礼部的议会殿。争论、札子、散文、报道，各式各样体裁的文字都在对人们呼喊。却是问多于答，争大于论。\""
  },
  {
    "file": "D:\\Users\\Eric Liu\\Documents\\Paradox Interactive\\Victoria 3\\nesnd-workbench\\backups\\pre-update-20261030T233944Z\\mod\\localization\\simp_chinese\\replace\\ce_french_empire_journals_l_simp_chinese.yml",
    "sha256": "352501e3baa2a92b9c04d96a464eea466bd411b4d4820916ae9b0c587063c844",
